{"5154340": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "ANTARTIDA", "steam_appid": 5154340, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5154340/extras/4768ac6da78f545bcb7c20a94c93555b.avif?t=1788120323\" width=540 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Discover what your objective is, find a way to get the vehicle moving, and venture across the remote reaches of Antarctica in complete solitude.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5154340/extras/a464ca4168fda200e57cf1ef625d2551.poster.avif?t=1788120323\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5154340/extras/a464ca4168fda200e57cf1ef625d2551.webm?t=1788120323\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5154340/extras/a464ca4168fda200e57cf1ef625d2551.mp4?t=1788120323\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Isolated from the world and surrounded by an endless white landscape, your only companions will be the sound of the engine, the radio, and the wind pounding against the walls of your small vehicle.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5154340/extras/08da4d23bd9d86ffcb35e072134d7391.poster.avif?t=1788120323\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5154340/extras/08da4d23bd9d86ffcb35e072134d7391.webm?t=1788120323\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5154340/extras/08da4d23bd9d86ffcb35e072134d7391.mp4?t=1788120323\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Listen to the transmissions. Get the coordinates right. Set your course.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5154340/extras/4561497bb7cc118cf7a6dfcba62bcc91.poster.avif?t=1788120323\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5154340/extras/4561497bb7cc118cf7a6dfcba62bcc91.webm?t=1788120323\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5154340/extras/4561497bb7cc118cf7a6dfcba62bcc91.mp4?t=1788120323\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><u><strong>Features:</strong></u></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >AN IMMERSIVE ANTARCTICA</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A desolate landscape and unforgiving weather await you. The vastness of the White Continent contrasts with the cramped space of your vehicle, turning <strong><i>ANTÁRTIDA </i></strong>into a claustrophobic and suspenseful experience.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >USE YOUR HEAD</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No one is going to explain everything you need to know. Learn to operate the vehicle, interpret the signals, and figure out what to do as you progress.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE ICE FORGIVES NOTHING</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crash because you weren't looking ahead while driving, freeze because you weren't paying attention to the heating, or simply fail in your attempt to survive the vastness of Antarctica. <strong>You won't be given a save point, a second chance, or any kind of help.</strong> If you like things easy, stay on your continent.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A SHORT EXPERIENCE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game lasts approximately 40 minutes on average, but this can vary depending on your skills and how prepared you are for the mission.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><u><strong>Lore:</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">It’s the early 1960s, and you have been sent by the Argentine government to the South Pole on a scientific mission to investigate meteorological phenomena never recorded before.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5154340/extras/4768ac6da78f545bcb7c20a94c93555b.avif?t=1788120323\" width=540 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Discover what your objective is, find a way to get the vehicle moving, and venture across the remote reaches of Antarctica in complete solitude.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5154340/extras/a464ca4168fda200e57cf1ef625d2551.poster.avif?t=1788120323\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_